---
// Original diagram for the proposed YouTube-like product design, not YouTube internals.
---

<figure
  class="video-product-architecture-diagram"
  aria-labelledby="video-product-architecture-caption"
>
  <svg
    class="video-product-architecture-diagram__desktop"
    viewBox="0 0 960 682"
    role="img"
    aria-labelledby="video-product-architecture-title video-product-architecture-desc"
  >
    <title id="video-product-architecture-title">
      模組化單體、MySQL 與獨立影音傳輸的最小架構
    </title>
    <desc id="video-product-architecture-desc"
      >控制路徑由模組化單體 API 與 MySQL 負責。已提交的 outbox 事件經 relay
      和持久佇列交給 worker。創作者直接上傳物件儲存，轉碼產物經 CDN
      到播放器，影音不穿過 API。</desc
    >
    <defs
