        ><path
          class="video-product-architecture-diagram__head"
          d="M 0 0 L 10 5 L 0 10 z"></path></marker
      ></defs
    >
    <text class="video-product-architecture-diagram__title" x="24" y="32"
      >第一版：模組化單體管理規則，影音走獨立資料路徑</text
    ><rect
      class="video-product-architecture-diagram__panel"
      x="20"
      y="66"
      width="920"
      height="202"
      rx="14"></rect><text
