      x="58"
      y="151">創作者／播放器</text
    ><text class="video-product-architecture-diagram__body" x="58" y="180"
      >建立上傳、改可見性</text
    ><text class="video-product-architecture-diagram__body" x="58" y="205"
      >請求播放授權</text
    ><rect
      class="video-product-architecture-diagram__card"
      x="285"
      y="120"
      width="330"
      height="120"
      rx="14"></rect><text
      class="video-product-architecture-diagram__label"
      x="303"
      y="151">模組化單體 API</text
    ><text class="video-product-architecture-diagram__body" x="303" y="180"
      >Upload / Video / Playback 模組</text
    ><text class="video-product-architecture-diagram__body" x="303" y="205"
      >先共用部署，保留明確責任</text
    ><rect
      class="video-product-architecture-diagram__card"
      x="685"
      y="120"
      width="230"
      height="120"
      rx="14"></rect><text
      class="video-product-architecture-diagram__label"
      x="703"
      y="151">MySQL</text
    ><text class="video-product-architecture-diagram__body" x="703" y="180"
      >影片、資產與工作狀態</text
    ><text class="video-product-architecture-diagram__body" x="703" y="205"
      >同一交易寫入 outbox</text
    ><path
      class="video-product-architecture-diagram__arrow"
      d="M 215 178 H 285"
      marker-end="url(#video-product-architecture-arrow)"></path><path
      class="video-product-architecture-diagram__arrow"
      d="M 615 178 H 685"
      marker-end="url(#video-product-architecture-arrow)"></path><rect
      class="video-product-architecture-diagram__panel"
      x="20"
      y="298"
      width="920"
      height="160"
      rx="14"></rect><text
      class="video-product-architecture-diagram__accent"
      x="40"
      y="328">背景路徑 · 允許重試，不能重複發布</text
    ><rect
      class="video-product-architecture-diagram__card"
      x="40"
      y="352"
      width="250"
      height="80"
      rx="14"></rect><text
