    ><text class="video-product-architecture-diagram__body" x="666" y="408"
      >版本化產物；完成後條件提交</text
    ><path
      class="video-product-architecture-diagram__arrow"
      d="M 290 392 H 355"
      marker-end="url(#video-product-architecture-arrow)"></path><path
      class="video-product-architecture-diagram__arrow"
      d="M 585 392 H 650"
      marker-end="url(#video-product-architecture-arrow)"></path><path
      class="video-product-architecture-diagram__dashed"
      d="M 800 240 V 282 H 28 V 392 H 40"
      marker-end="url(#video-product-architecture-arrow)"></path><rect
      class="video-product-architecture-diagram__panel"
      x="20"
      y="488"
      width="920"
      height="170"
      rx="14"></rect><text
      class="video-product-architecture-diagram__accent"
      x="40"
      y="518">影音位元組路徑 · API 不代理大檔傳輸</text
    ><rect
      class="video-product-architecture-diagram__focus"
      x="40"
      y="546"
      width="175"
      height="82"
      rx="14"></rect><text
      class="video-product-architecture-diagram__label"
      x="127.5"
      y="576"
      text-anchor="middle">創作者</text
    ><text
      class="video-product-architecture-diagram__body"
      x="127.5"
      y="602"
      text-anchor="middle">直接分塊上傳</text
    ><rect
      class="video-product-architecture-diagram__focus"
      x="285"
      y="546"
      width="260"
      height="82"
      rx="14"></rect><text
      class="video-product-architecture-diagram__label"
      x="415.0"
      y="576"
      text-anchor="middle">物件儲存</text
    ><text
      class="video-product-architecture-diagram__body"
      x="415.0"
      y="602"
      text-anchor="middle">原檔 / 不可變版本產物</text
    ><rect
      class="video-product-architecture-diagram__focus"
      x="615"
      y="546"
      width="135"
      height="82"
      rx="14"></rect><text
      class="video-product-architecture-diagram__label"
      x="682.5"
      y="576"
      text-anchor="middle">CDN</text
    ><text
      class="video-product-architecture-diagram__body"
      x="682.5"
      y="602"
      text-anchor="middle">授權＋快取</text
    ><rect
      class="video-product-architecture-diagram__focus"
      x="820"
      y="546"
      width="95"
      height="82"
      rx="14"></rect><text
      class="video-product-architecture-diagram__label"
      x="867.5"
      y="576"
      text-anchor="middle">播放器</text
    ><text
      class="video-product-architecture-diagram__body"
      x="867.5"
      y="602"
      text-anchor="middle">分段下載</text
    ><path
      class="video-product-architecture-diagram__arrow"
      d="M 215 587 H 285"
      marker-end="url(#video-product-architecture-arrow)"></path><path
      class="video-product-architecture-diagram__arrow"
      d="M 545 587 H 615"
      marker-end="url(#video-product-architecture-arrow)"></path><path
      class="video-product-architecture-diagram__arrow"
      d="M 750 587 H 820"
      marker-end="url(#video-product-architecture-arrow)"></path><path
      class="video-product-architecture-diagram__dashed"
      d="M 782 432 V 474 H 415 V 546"
      marker-end="url(#video-product-architecture-arrow)"></path>
  </svg>
  <div class="video-product-architecture-diagram__mobile">
    <ol class="video-product-architecture-diagram__steps">
      <li>
        <span class="video-product-architecture-diagram__step-label"
          >控制路徑</span
        ><strong>客戶端 → 模組化單體 API → MySQL</strong><p>
          Upload、Video、Playback 模組先共用部署。影片狀態與 outbox
          事件在同一交易提交。
        </p>
      </li><li>
        <span class="video-product-architecture-diagram__step-label"
          >背景路徑</span
        ><strong>Outbox relay → 持久佇列 → worker</strong><p>
          事件可重送，工作可重試；以 job ID、產物版本與條件提交守住發布邊界。
        </p>
      </li><li>
        <span class="video-product-architecture-diagram__step-label"
          >影音位元組路徑</span
        ><strong>創作者 → 物件儲存 → CDN → 播放器</strong><p>
          創作者直接分塊上傳；worker 讀原檔、寫版本化產物。API 不代理大檔。
        </p>
      </li>
    </ol><p class="video-product-architecture-diagram__mobile-note">
      線路分開是為了分開擴充與故障影響，不代表第一版就要拆成微服務。
    </p>
  </div>
  <figcaption id="video-product-architecture-caption">
    圖
    2｜實線是主要請求或資料方向，虛線跨接非同步工作；控制、處理與位元組傳輸各有責任。
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .video-product-architecture-diagram {
    margin: var(--space-xl) 0;
    color: var(--dg-ink);
  }
  .video-product-architecture-diagram svg {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    font-family: var(--font-body);
  }
  .video-product-architecture-diagram__desktop {
    overflow: visible;
  }
  .video-product-architecture-diagram__mobile {
    display: none;
  }
  .video-product-architecture-diagram__card {
    fill: var(--dg-surface);
    stroke: var(--dg-rule-strong);
    stroke-width: 1.5;
  }
  .video-product-architecture-diagram__panel {
    fill: var(--dg-surface-2);
    stroke: var(--dg-rule);
    stroke-width: 1.5;
  }
  .video-product-architecture-diagram__focus {
    fill: #edf5f0;
    stroke: #35734c;
    stroke-width: 1.5;
  }
  .video-product-architecture-diagram__warn {
    fill: #fff2e9;
    stroke: #ad4d17;
    stroke-width: 1.5;
  }
  .video-product-architecture-diagram__body {
    fill: var(--dg-ink-2);
    font-size: 14px;
  }
  .video-product-architecture-diagram__title {
    fill: var(--dg-ink);
    font-size: 19px;
    font-weight: 800;
  }
  .video-product-architecture-diagram__label {
    fill: var(--dg-ink);
    font-size: 16px;
    font-weight: 700;
  }
  .video-product-architecture-diagram__small {
    fill: var(--dg-muted);
    font-size: 13px;
  }
  .video-product-architecture-diagram__accent {
    fill: #256442;
    font-size: 15px;
    font-weight: 700;
  }
  .video-product-architecture-diagram__warning {
    fill: #9a4310;
    font-size: 15px;
    font-weight: 700;
  }
  .video-product-architecture-diagram__mono {
    fill: var(--dg-ink-2);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 13px;
  }
  .video-product-architecture-diagram__arrow {
    fill: none;
    stroke: var(--dg-rule-strong);
    stroke-width: 2;
  }
  .video-product-architecture-diagram__dashed {
    fill: none;
    stroke: var(--dg-rule-strong);
    stroke-width: 2;
    stroke-dasharray: 6 5;
  }
  .video-product-architecture-diagram__head {
    fill: var(--dg-rule-strong);
  }
  .video-product-architecture-diagram__rule {
    fill: none;
    stroke: var(--dg-rule);
    stroke-width: 1.5;
  }
  .video-product-architecture-diagram__dot {
    fill: #35734c;
  }
  .video-product-architecture-diagram__steps {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    margin: 0;
    display: grid;
    gap: var(--space-sm);
  }
  .video-product-architecture-diagram__steps li {
    border: 1px solid var(--dg-rule-strong);
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
    padding: var(--space-md);
    background: var(--dg-surface);
  }
  .video-product-architecture-diagram__steps strong {
    display: block;
    font-size: var(--text-base);
    line-height: 1.5;
    color: var(--dg-ink);
  }
  .video-product-architecture-diagram__steps p {
    margin: var(--space-xs) 0 0;
    color: var(--dg-ink-2);
    font-size: var(--text-sm);
    line-height: 1.7;
    overflow-wrap: anywhere;
  }
  .video-product-architecture-diagram__step-label {
    display: block;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-xs);
    color: #256442;
    font-size: var(--text-xs);
    font-weight: 700;
  }
  .video-product-architecture-diagram__mobile-note {
    padding: var(--space-md);
    border-left: 3px solid #ad4d17;
    background: var(--dg-surface-2);
    font-size: var(--text-sm);
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: var(--dg-ink-2);
  }
  .video-product-architecture-diagram figcaption {
    margin-top: var(--space-sm);
    color: var(--dg-muted);
    font-size: var(--text-sm);
    line-height: 1.7;
  }
  :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .video-product-architecture-diagram__focus {
    fill: #183b2b;
    stroke: #72ba8c;
  }
  :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .video-product-architecture-diagram__warn {
    fill: #3f2b1c;
    stroke: #edaa78;
  }
  :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .video-product-architecture-diagram__accent,
  :global(:root[data-theme="dark"])
    .video-product-architecture-diagram__step-label {
    fill: #8ed1a8;
    color: #8ed1a8;
  }
  :global(:root[data-theme="dark"])
    .video-product-architecture-diagram__warning {
    fill: #f4ba8d;
  }
  :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .video-product-architecture-diagram__dot {
    fill: #72ba8c;
  }
  :global(:root[data-theme="dark"])
    .video-product-architecture-diagram__mobile-note {
    border-left-color: #edaa78;
  }
  @media (max-width: 48rem) {
    .video-product-architecture-diagram__desktop {
      display: none !important;
    }
    .video-product-architecture-diagram__mobile {
      display: block !important;
    }
  }
</style>
